    "description": "### Impact\nPrevent unauthorized disclosure of restricted topic and private message titles by enforcing visibility checks during internal link extraction and duplicate lookup. Internal URLs are now only canonicalized to include slugs if the user has permission to view the target, and unauthorized links are omitted from the composer's duplicate link suggestions.\n\n### Patches\nUpgrade to the patched version.\n\n### Workarounds\nUpgrade to the patched version.",
